{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an apple.<br>No, not a metaphor. You are truly an apple.<br>Red, shiny, vibrant skin; full and ripe inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no movement in this game. No jumping. No enemies.<br>You simply exist. You stay still. You think.<br>You\u2019re being watched\u2026 perhaps studied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes, the play of light paints your skin in shifting colors.<br>But still, you remain\u2026 just an apple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And maybe, that means more than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can being an apple be a game?<br>Can stillness be an action?<br>Can being observed be a challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We believe it can.<br>And this game exists for exactly that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We leave you with just one question:<br>Can you truly remain\u2026 an apple?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2634380?t=1747436206","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2634380?t=1747436206","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634380/544e87168fac696ffd4c0ab3a7479d01cacd793a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747436206","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634380/544e87168fac696ffd4c0ab3a7479d01cacd793a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747436206","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an apple.<br>No, not a metaphor. You are truly an apple.<br>Red, shiny, vibrant skin; full and ripe inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no movement in this game. No jumping. No enemies.<br>You simply exist. You stay still. You think.<br>You\u2019re being watched\u2026 perhaps studied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes, the play of light paints your skin in shifting colors.<br>But still, you remain\u2026 just an apple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And maybe, that means more than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can being an apple be a game?<br>Can stillness be an action?<br>Can being observed be a challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We believe it can.<br>And this game exists for exactly that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We leave you with just one question:<br>Can you truly remain\u2026 an apple?</p>","developers":["Kagan \u00d6r\u00fcn"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634380/2e198c945d940a4b7531ccff819dec4d1d0d3b26/header.jpg?t=1747436206","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Dual Core+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Dual Core+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB VRAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257138735,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138735/movie480.mp4?t=1747436204","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138735/movie_max.mp4?t=1747436204"},"name":"apples2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257138735/089085838bf52c0346c2e8c7531742b572c95681/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747436204","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138735/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747436204","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138735/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747436204"}}],"name":"The Apple Si